mouldings and interior wall paneling under the SterlingOSB Zero, CaberFloor, and CaberMDF brands. It also provides bioenergy and green raw materials. Its products are used in home construction, repair and remodeling, paper, tissue, and box materials, and industrial applications. It sells its products to major retail chains, dealers, contractor supply yards, and wholesalers, as well as industrial customers for further processing or as components for other products in Canada, the United States, the United Kingdom, Europe, and internationally. The company was founded in 1955 and is headquartered in Vancouver, Canada.","employees":9600,"website":"https://www.westfraser.com","country":"Canada","city":"Vancouver","officers":[{"name":"Mr. Sean P. McLaren","title":"CEO, President & Director"},{"name":"Mr. Christopher A. Virostek CA, CPA, HBBA","title":"EVP & Chief Financial Officer"},{"name":"Ms. Robin A. Lampard","title":"Senior Vice-President of Corporate Services"}]},"sector_medians":{"fpe":12.02,"tpe":18.92,"ps":2.355,"pfcf":23.85,"peg":1.72,"pb":2.385,"ev_ebitda":9.163,"rev_growth":0.165,"eps_growth":0.43,"eps_growth_fwd":0.3337,"eps_growth_next":0.1503,"div_yield":0.0087,"roe":0.1127,"roa":0.06788,"de":44.82,"gross_margin":0.3339,"op_margin":0.1746,"profit_margin":0.06777,"current_ratio":2.085},"valuation":[{"k":"fpe","label":"Forward P/E","v":39.14,"sector":12.02,"verdict":"Overvalued"},{"k":"tpe","label":"TTM P/E","v":-1,"sector":18.92,"verdict":"Loss-making"},{"k":"ps","label":"Price / Sales","v":1.007,"sector":2.355,"verdict":"Undervalued"},{"k":"pfcf","label":"Price / FCF","v":-1,"sector":23.85,"verdict":"Negative FCF"},{"k":"peg","label":"PEG","v":null,"sector":1.72,"verdict":"—"},{"k":"pb","label":"Price / Book","v":0.9476,"sector":2.385,"verdict":"Undervalued"},{"k":"de","label":"Debt / Equity (%)","v":7.025,"sector":44.82,"verdict":"Low debt"},{"k":"rev_growth","label":"Revenue growth","v":-0.064,"sector":0.165,"verdict":"Weak"},{"k":"eps_growth","label":"EPS